# Gloryheath Lynx: "Whenever this creature attacks while saddled, search your library for a basic Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle"
# (CR 702.171b, 701.23). Turn 1: Saddle 2 is refused with only Zephyr Sprite (power 1) to tap. Turn 3: Savannah Lions (power 2) saddles the Lynx; the search may not find
# Scrubland (a Plains, but not a basic one), only the basic Plains, which is revealed and put into hand; Lifelink gains 2 for the combat damage. Turn 5: unsaddled, the
# Lynx attacks without searching, and the library keeps its size.

